## Why this matters

Body copy renders through `.prose`, which reads the same tokens as the rest of the site — so
whatever you set in `src/theme.config.ts` applies here too.

![Placeholder](../../src/assets/placeholder-2.jpg)

## Notes

- Bullet lists get the em-dash marker from the mockup.
- **Bold** lifts to full ink weight.
- [Links](/) get the thin underline.

